# Skeleton Patterns

**Domain**: `'skel'` | **Prefix**: `skel_` | **Indent**: Tabs

## ACF Blocks
Register in `functions/register-acf-blocks.php`:
```php
$block_types = array( 'Hero Slider', 'New Block' );
$blocks_with_js = array( 'Hero Slider', 'New Block' );  // If needs JS
```
Auto-generates: `acf-blocks/{slug}.php`, `src/sass/partials/acf-blocks/_{slug}.scss`, `src/js/custom/acf-blocks/{slug}.js`

## Block Template
```php
<?php
if ( isset( $block['data']['preview_image'] ) ) { echo '<img src="' . esc_url( $block['data']['preview_image'] ) . '">'; return; }
if ( 'on' !== get_field( 'display' ) ) { return; }
$items = get_field( 'items' );
if ( ! is_array( $items ) || empty( $items ) ) { return; }

$spacing = get_field( 'spacing' );
$spacing_top = $spacing['top']['spacing_top'] ?? '';
$spacing_bottom = $spacing['bottom']['spacing_bottom'] ?? '';
?>
<section class="block-section section <?php echo esc_attr( "{$spacing_top} {$spacing_bottom} " . get_field( 'custom_classes' ) ); ?>"
	style="<?php echo esc_attr( get_field( 'custom_css' ) ); ?>"
	id="<?php echo esc_attr( get_field( 'unique_id' ) ); ?>" data-inview>
	<div class="container">
		<?php foreach ( $items as $item ) : ?><!-- Content --><?php endforeach; ?>
	</div>
</section>
```

## HTML Structure
```html
<section class="hero-section"><div class="container"></div></section>  <!-- *-section -->
<div class="content-block"></div>                                       <!-- *-block -->
<div class="img-cover-block"><img src="" class="img-cover" /></div>    <!-- img pattern -->
```

## Data Attributes
| Animation | Toggles |
|-----------|---------|
| `data-inview` - viewport trigger | `data-toggle-click="name"` |
| `data-aos="fade-up"` | `data-toggle-group="group"` |
| `data-aos-stagger-item` | `data-toggle-link="name"` / `data-toggle-hover="name"` |

